  "details": "WMR View Clipping Plane Bug\nI think this bug was introduced in VRChat 2020.3.3p1, build 994\nI don't own a WMR but WMR users are effected by this bug in my world. It also happens in other worlds.\nIf a large distant clipping plane is set, WMR users have bugged vision beyond a certain distance. In the attached screenshots you can see that the terrain disappears after a very short distance (first LOD?), and distant meshes appear and disappear depending on view angle.\nThe Camera is unaffected by the bug, showing what the user should be able to see.\nWorld : Test Pilots : wrld_e4908cea-023b-4749-9ad7-a898b12996e7",
